msgid "Island rich in gold; region of Thailand/Malacca."
msgstr "金の豊富な島; タイやマラッカ地方にあったとされる。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Golden Horn"; Byzantine Peninsula (now Turkey), or
#. its inlet.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5428
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Chrysokeras"
msgstr "クリソケラス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5428
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Golden Horn”; Byzantine Peninsula (now Turkey), or its inlet."
msgstr "「ゴールデンホーン」; ビザンチン半島 (現在のトルコ) 、またはそこにある入り江 (金角湾)。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Electra's island near River Eridanus; famous for amber
#. formed from tears shed by Phaethon's sisters.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5430
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Electris"
msgstr "エレクトリス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5430
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Electra's island near River Eridanus; famous for amber formed from tears "
"shed by Phaethon's sisters."
msgstr "エリダヌス川に近いエレクトラの島; ファエトンの姉妹が流した涙から形成された琥珀で有名。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); The "Fountain of Youth;" a fountain in India.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5432
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Juventae Fons"
msgstr "ユウェンタエ・フォンス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5432
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "The “Fountain of Youth;” a fountain in India."
msgstr "「若返りの泉」を意味する; インドにある泉。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Home of Dioscuri," Polydeuces and Pollux; symbolic
#. name for Sparta.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5434
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Dioscuria"
msgstr "ディオスクリア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5434
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Home of Dioscuri,” Polydeuces and Pollux; symbolic name for Sparta."
msgstr "「ディオスクリの故郷」、ディオスクリはポリュデウケスとポルックス兄弟のこと、スパルタの象徴的な名前。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Biblical fourth River of Paradise.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5436
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Euphrates"
msgstr "エウフラテス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5436
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Biblical fourth River of Paradise."
msgstr "聖書に登場する楽園の4番目の川。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Far northern lake.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5438
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Hyperboreus (Lacus)"
msgstr "ヒペルボレウス(湖)"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5438
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Far northern lake."
msgstr "極北湖。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Region on the Po River, Italy.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5440
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Eridania"
msgstr "エリダニア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5440
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Region on the Po River, Italy."
msgstr "イタリア、ポー川の地域。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Present Jumna River, India.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5442
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Jamuna"
msgstr "ジャムナー"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5442
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Present Jumna River, India."
msgstr "現在のインド、ジャンナ川。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Named for Thule; may be middle Norway; used to
#. indicate far northern lands.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5444
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "II Thyle I"
msgstr "IIティレI"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5444
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Named for Thule; may be middle Norway; used to indicate far northern lands."
msgstr "テュレにちなんで名付けられた; おそらくノルウェー中部で、極北の地を指すのに使われる。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Greece.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5446
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Hellas"
msgstr "ヘラス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5446
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Greece."
msgstr "ギリシャの古名。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); The Dardanelles.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5448
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Hellespontus"
msgstr "ヘレスポントス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5448
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "The Dardanelles."
msgstr "ダーダネルス海峡の古名。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "The Occiden"; name for Italy (Greek); or Spain
#. (Roman) or West area of Ethiopians where sun sank.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5450
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Hesperia"
msgstr "ヘスペリア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5450
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"”The Occiden”; name for Italy (Greek); or Spain (Roman) or West area of "
"Ethiopians where sun sank."
msgstr "「西洋」; (ギリシャでの) イタリアの名称。もしくは(ローマでの) スペインの名称、または太陽が沈むエチオピアの西部地域。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Tigris River, Babylonia; Biblical third River of
#. Paradise.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5452
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Hiddekel"
msgstr "ヒデケル"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5452
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Tigris River, Babylonia; Biblical third River of Paradise."
msgstr "バビロニアのチグリス川; 聖書に登場する楽園の3番目の川。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Classically, Iapygia was all of Apulia, or just the
#. Salentine Peninsula.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5454
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Iapygia (Iapigia)"
msgstr "イアピュギア (イアピギア)"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5454
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Classically, Iapygia was all of Apulia, or just the Salentine Peninsula."
msgstr "古典的には、イアピュギアはアプリア全体、あるいはサレンティネ半島だけを指した。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Land where Icarus lived (Crete).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5456
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Icaria"
msgstr "イカリア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5456
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Land where Icarus lived (Crete)."
msgstr "イカルスが住んでいた土地 (クレタ島) 。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Designation of purported drowned continent south of
#. India; also relates to lemur monkeys found on Madagascar and Sunda Islands.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5458
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Lemuria"
msgstr "レムリア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5458
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Designation of purported drowned continent south of India; also relates to "
"lemur monkeys found on Madagascar and Sunda Islands."
msgstr "インド南方で沈没したと主張されていた大陸の名称; マダガスカル島やスンダ列島に生息するキツネザル (学名レムール) にも関連する。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Ismenian Lake"; Ismenia is poetic term for Thebes.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5460
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Ismenius Lacus"
msgstr "イスメニウス湖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5460
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Ismenian Lake”; Ismenia is poetic term for Thebes."
msgstr "「イスメニア湖」; イスメニアはテーベの詩的な用語。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Man-eating giants who lived in the west.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5462
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Laestrygon (Laestrigon)"
msgstr "ラエストリュゴン (ラエストリゴン)"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5462
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Man-eating giants who lived in the west."
msgstr "西方に生息していた人喰いの巨人族。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Area from W. Egypt to greater Syrtis.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5464
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Libya"
msgstr "リビア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5464
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Area from W. Egypt to greater Syrtis."
msgstr "エジプト西部から大シルティス (現在のシドラ湾) までの地域。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Roman Moon goddess Luna; "Luna's Swamp," or African
#. Lunae Mountains where Nile was thought to originate.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5466
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Lunae Palus"
msgstr "ルナエ沼"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5466
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Roman Moon goddess Luna; “Luna's Swamp,” or African Lunae Mountains where "
"Nile was thought to originate."
msgstr "ローマ神話の月の女神ルナ; 「ルナの沼」、もしくはナイル川の源流地と考えられていたアフリカのルナエ山脈。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Ethiopian island on Nile; now Atbar.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5468
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Meroe"
msgstr "メロエ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5468
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Ethiopian island on Nile; now Atbar."
msgstr "ナイル川にあるエチオピアの島; 現在のアトゥバル。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Name for Acidalian (Venusian) fountain in Boeotia
#. where the Graces bathed.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5470
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Mare Acidalium"
msgstr "アキダリウム海"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5470
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Name for Acidalian (Venusian) fountain in Boeotia where the Graces bathed."
msgstr "ギリシャ神話三美神が沐浴したボエオティアにあるアキダリア (ヴィーナス) の泉の名前。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "South Sea"
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5472
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Mare Australe"
msgstr "アウストラレ海"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5472
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”South Sea”"
msgstr "「南の海」の意味"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "North Sea"
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5474
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Mare Boreum"
msgstr "ボレウム海"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5474
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”North Sea”"
msgstr "「北の海」の意味。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Cronian Sea", northern part of World Sea where
#. eternal dead calm, dangerous to ships, prevailed.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5476
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Mare Chronium"
msgstr "クロニウム海"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5476
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"”Cronian Sea”, northern part of World Sea where eternal dead calm, dangerous"
" to ships, prevailed."
msgstr "「クロノスの海」、永遠の死者が静まり、船にとって危険で、優勢な「世界の海」の北部。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Cimmerians were ancient Thracian seafarers; "far
#. western sea" (Homer).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5478
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Mare Cimmerium"
msgstr "キンメリウム海"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5478
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Cimmerians were ancient Thracian seafarers; “far western sea” (Homer)."
msgstr "キンメリア人は古代トラキアの船員だった; 「極西の海」(ホメロス) 。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Indian Ocean.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5480
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Mare Erythraeum"
msgstr "エリトゥラエウム海"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5480
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Indian Ocean."
msgstr "インド洋。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Adriatic Sea.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5482
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Mare Hadriacum"
msgstr "ハドリアクム海"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5482
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Adriatic Sea."
msgstr "アドリア海。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Named for Constellation Serpens (the snake).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5484
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Mare Serpentis"
msgstr "セルペンティス海"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5484
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Named for Constellation Serpens (the snake)."
msgstr "へび座 (蛇) にちなんで名付けられた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Sea of the Sirens."
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5486
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Mare Sirenum"
msgstr "シレヌム海"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5486
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Sea of the Sirens.”"
msgstr "「サイレンの海」。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Lake of the Nile."
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5488
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Niliacus Lacus"
msgstr "ニリアクス湖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5488
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Lake of the Nile.”"
msgstr "「ナイルの湖」の意味。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Horn of the Nile;" part of "Nulus" Canal.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5490
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Nilokeras"
msgstr "ニロケラス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5490
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Horn of the Nile;” part of “Nulus” Canal."
msgstr "「ナイルの角」の意味; 「ヌルス」運河の一部分。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Syrtis of the Nile; part of Nilus (Nile) Canal.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5492
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Nilosyrtis"
msgstr "ニロシルティス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5492
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Syrtis of the Nile; part of Nilus (Nile) Canal."
msgstr "ナイル高原; ニルス (ナイル) 運河の一部分"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Tyrrhenian Sea, between Italy and Sicily.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5494
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Mare Tyrrhenum"
msgstr "ティレニア海"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5494
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Tyrrhenian Sea, between Italy and Sicily."
msgstr "ティレニア海、イタリアとシチリア島の間に広がる。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Pearl Bay," after Pearl Coast, South India.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5496
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Margaritifer Sinus"
msgstr "マルガリティフェル入江"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5496
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Pearl Bay,” after Pearl Coast, South India."
msgstr "「真珠湾」の意味。南インドの真珠海岸にちなむ。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Land of Memnon, King of Ethiopia.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5498
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Memnonia"
msgstr "メンノニア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5498
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Land of Memnon, King of Ethiopia."
msgstr "エチオピア王メムノンの地。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Moeris Lake;" Moeris was Egyptian lake in Libyan
#. Desert.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5500
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Moeris Lacus"
msgstr "モエリス湖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5500
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Moeris Lake;” Moeris was Egyptian lake in Libyan Desert."
msgstr "学名 : Moeris Lacus; モエリスはリビア砂漠にあるエジプトの湖。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Biblical town bordering Edom.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5502
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Moab"
msgstr "モアブ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5502
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Biblical town bordering Edom."
msgstr "エドムと国境を接する聖書に記載のある町。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Named for the drink of the gods.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5504
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Nectar"
msgstr "ネクタル"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5504
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Named for the drink of the gods."
msgstr "神々が飲むお酒にちなんで名付けられた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Biblical; "Noah's (Region)."
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5506
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Noachis"
msgstr "ノアキス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5506
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Biblical; “Noah's (Region).”"
msgstr "聖書の記載 ;「ノアの (地域) 」。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Snows of Olympus;" Olympus was mountain home of gods
#. in Greece.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5508
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Nix Olympica"
msgstr "ニクス・オリンピカ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5508
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Snows of Olympus;” Olympus was mountain home of gods in Greece."
msgstr "「オリンポス山の雪」; オリンポス山はギリシャの神々が鎮座する山。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Region of Ogygos;" Ogygos was ancient King of Thebes
#. or Athens, Greece.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5510
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Ogygis Regio"
msgstr "オギギス地域"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5510
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"”Region of Ogygos;” Ogygos was ancient King of Thebes or Athens, Greece."
msgstr "「オギゴス地域」; オギゴスは古代ギリシャのテーベ、またはアテネの王。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Ancient and modern Greek city.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5512
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Olympia"
msgstr "オリンピア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5512
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Ancient and modern Greek city."
msgstr "ギリシャの古代都市で現在にも続く。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Of Phaethon;" who recklessly drove Chariot of Sun.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5514
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Phaethontis"
msgstr "ファエトンティス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5514
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Of Phaethon;” who recklessly drove Chariot of Sun."
msgstr "「ファエトンの」の意味; 太陽のチャリオットを無謀に運転した。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Floating island (present Delos) where Leto bore Apollo
#. and Artemis.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5516
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Ortygia"
msgstr "オルティギア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5516
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Floating island (present Delos) where Leto bore Apollo and Artemis."
msgstr "レトがアポロとアルテミスを産んだ浮島 (現在のデロス島)。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Lake (swamp into which Oxus River flows; i.e. Sea of
#. Aral).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5518
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Oxia Palus"
msgstr "オクシア沼"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5518
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Lake (swamp into which Oxus River flows; i.e. Sea of Aral)."
msgstr "湖 (オクサス川、現在のアムダリヤ川が流れ込む沼地、つまりアラル海) 。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Present Amoo-Darya River.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5520
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Oxus"
msgstr "オクサス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5520
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Present Amoo-Darya River."
msgstr "現在のアムダリヤ川。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Situated near Heliopolis, Egypt; or island in Red Sea
#. rich in frankincense, gold, silver, thus Utopia.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5522
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Panchaia"
msgstr "パンカイア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5522
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Situated near Heliopolis, Egypt; or island in Red Sea rich in frankincense, "
"gold, silver, thus Utopia."
msgstr "エジプトのヘリオポリスの近くに位置する。あるいは乳香や金銀が豊富、したがってユートピアになる紅海に浮かぶ島。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Woman who let loose evils of world when she opened a
#. box.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5524
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Pandorae Fretum"
msgstr "パンドラエ海峡"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5524
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Woman who let loose evils of world when she opened a box."
msgstr "箱を開けて、この世の悪を解き放った女性。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Lake of the Phoenix;" Arabia or India.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5526
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Phoenicis Lacus"
msgstr "フェニキス湖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5526
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Lake of the Phoenix;” Arabia or India."
msgstr "学名 : Phoenicis Lacus;「フェニックス湖」の意味。アラビアもしくはインド。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Phrixus' Region;" Phrixus and sister Helle escaped
#. sacrifice in Boeotia on back of ram with golden fleece.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5528
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Phrixi Regio"
msgstr "フリクシ地域"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5528
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"”Phrixus' Region;” Phrixus and sister Helle escaped sacrifice in Boeotia on "
"back of ram with golden fleece."
msgstr "「フリクススの地域」の意味; フリクススと妹ヘレーはボイオティアで金色の羊の背中に乗って犠牲を逃れた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Prometheus' Bay; Greek mythological character.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5530
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Promethei Sinus"
msgstr "プロメテイ湾"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5530
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Prometheus' Bay; Greek mythological character."
msgstr "プロメテウス湾; ギリシャ神話の人物。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); The Sea of Marmora, Asia Minor.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5532
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Propontis"
msgstr "プロポンティス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5532
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "The Sea of Marmora, Asia Minor."
msgstr "小アジアにあるマルモラ海。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Proteus' Region;" Proteus was a sea god with a gift
#. of prophecy.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5534
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Protei Regio"
msgstr "プロテイ地域"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5534
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Proteus' Region;” Proteus was a sea god with a gift of prophecy."
msgstr "「プロテウス地域」; プロテウスは予言の才能を持つ海神だった。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Designation of first (Eastern) part of "Nilus" or Nile
#. Canal.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5536
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Protonilus"
msgstr "プロトニルス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5536
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Designation of first (Eastern) part of “Nilus” or Nile Canal."
msgstr "「ニルス」またはナイル運河の1番目 (東側) の部分の名称。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Pyrrha's Region;" named for Pyrrha, wife of
#. Deucalion.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5538
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Pyrrhae Regio"
msgstr "ピラエ地域"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5538
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Pyrrha's Region;” named for Pyrrha, wife of Deucalion."
msgstr "「ピラ地域」; デウカリオンの妻ピラにちなんで名付けられた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Middle Bay," from Flammarion map.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5540
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Sinus Meridiani"
msgstr "メリディアニ湾"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5540
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Middle Bay,” from Flammarion map."
msgstr "「中央の湾」の意味; フラマリオンの地図による。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Today's Red Sea; Saba was part of southern Arabian
#. Peninsula.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5542
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Sinus Sabaeus"
msgstr "サバエウス湾"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5542
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Today's Red Sea; Saba was part of southern Arabian Peninsula."
msgstr "今日の紅海; サバア (Saba) はアラビア半島南部にあった一国家。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Egyptian messenger god.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5544
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Thoth"
msgstr "トート"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5544
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Egyptian messenger god."
msgstr "エジプトの伝令の神。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Province in Near East including Phoenicia; or one of
#. the Cyclades (Homer).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5546
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Syria"
msgstr "シリア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5546
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Province in Near East including Phoenicia; or one of the Cyclades (Homer)."
msgstr "フェニキアを含む中近東の属州; またはキクラデス諸島の島 (ホメロス) 。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Libyan Gulf, now Gulf of Sirte.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5548
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Syrtis Major"
msgstr "シルティス・マヨル"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5548
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Libyan Gulf, now Gulf of Sirte."
msgstr "リビア湾、現在はシルテ湾と呼ばれる。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Biblical; named for area next to Mare Erythraeum
#. (Indian Ocean).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5550
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Sinai"
msgstr "シナイ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5550
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Biblical; named for area next to Mare Erythraeum (Indian Ocean)."
msgstr "聖書由来; \"Mare Erythraeum\" (インド洋) に隣接する地域にちなんで名付けられた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Region inhabited by Sithonii; synonym of Thrace.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5552
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Sithonius Lacus"
msgstr "シトニウス湖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5552
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Region inhabited by Sithonii; synonym of Thrace."
msgstr "シトン人のいる地域;  トラキアの異名。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Lake of the Sun"; the so-called "Eye of Mars,"
#. connecting East with West.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5554
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Solis Lacus"
msgstr "ソリス湖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5554
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"”Lake of the Sun”; the so-called “Eye of Mars,” connecting East with West."
msgstr "「太陽の湖」の意味; いわゆる「火星の目」、東と西を繋ぐ。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Great river around nether region, which souls must
#. cross on journey from Earth.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5556
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Styx"
msgstr "スティクス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5556
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Great river around nether region, which souls must cross on journey from "
"Earth."
msgstr "地下地域を囲む大きな川、魂が地上から旅する際に渡らなければならない。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Present River Don, Russia.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5558
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Tanais"
msgstr "タナイス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5558
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Present River Don, Russia."
msgstr "現在のロシアを流れるドン川。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Land of Agelessness."
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5560
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Uchronia"
msgstr "ウクロニア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5560
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Land of Agelessness.”"
msgstr "「不老不死の土地」。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Land of sweet-scented perfumes"; South Yemen or
#. India.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5562
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Thymiamata"
msgstr "ティミアマタ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5562
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Land of sweet-scented perfumes”; South Yemen or India."
msgstr "「甘い香りの香水の国」; 南イエメンまったはインド。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Greek valley south of Mt. Olympus noted for its
#. beauty.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5564
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Tempe"
msgstr "テンペ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5564
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Greek valley south of Mt. Olympus noted for its beauty."
msgstr "その美しさで知られるオリンポス山の南にあるギリシャの渓谷。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Connecting link between East and West; ancient Spanish
#. town Tartessus.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5566
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Tharsis"
msgstr "タルシス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5566
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Connecting link between East and West; ancient Spanish town Tartessus."
msgstr "東西を繋ぐリンク; スペインの古代都市タルテッソス。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Crossroad of Charon"; meeting place of several
#. netherworld Canals.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5568
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Trivium Charontis"
msgstr "トリビウム・カロンティス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5568
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Crossroad of Charon”; meeting place of several netherworld Canals."
msgstr "「カロンの交差点」の意味; いくつかの冥界の運河が合流する場所。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Tithonian Lake"; Tithonus received from his wife Eos
#. eternal life but not eternal youth.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5570
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Tithonius Lacus"
msgstr "ティトニウス湖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5570
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"”Tithonian Lake”; Tithonus received from his wife Eos eternal life but not "
"eternal youth."
msgstr "「ティトヌスの湖」の意味; ティトヌスは妻エオスから永遠の命を受け取った、永遠の若さは受け取らなかった。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "White Tract" in Latin.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5572
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Tractus Albus"
msgstr "トラクトス・アルブス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5572
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”White Tract” in Latin."
msgstr "ラテン語で「白い区域」を意味する。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Classical name for Sicily.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5574
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Trinacria"
msgstr "トリナクリア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5574
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Classical name for Sicily."
msgstr "シシリー地方の古名。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Means "Shadow" in Latin.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5576
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Umbra"
msgstr "ウンバラ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5576
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Means “Shadow” in Latin."
msgstr "ラテン語で「影」を意味する。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Greek, meaning "nowhere"; ideal state.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5578
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Utopia"
msgstr "ユートピア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5578
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Greek, meaning “nowhere”; ideal state."
msgstr "ギリシャ語で「何処にも無い」を意味する; 理想的な状態のこと。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Named for Chinese Emperor Yao; flood occurred during
#. his reign.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5580
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Yaonis Regio"
msgstr "ヤオニス地域"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5580
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Named for Chinese Emperor Yao; flood occurred during his reign."
msgstr "中国の堯帝 (ヤオ・ディ) にちなんで名付けられた; 治世中に洪水が起きた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Named for Vulcan, Roman god of fire.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5582
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Vulcani Pelagus"
msgstr "ウルカニ・ペラグス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5582
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Named for Vulcan, Roman god of fire."
msgstr "ローマの火の神ウルカン (ヴァルカン) にちなんで名付けられた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Golden-Yellow Land."
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5584
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Xanthe"
msgstr "クサンテ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5584
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "”Golden-Yellow Land.”"
msgstr "「黄金の地」。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Land of the west wind.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5586
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Zephyria"
msgstr "ゼフィリア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5586
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Land of the west wind."
msgstr "西風の地。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Southern Scandinavia.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5588
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Scandia"
msgstr "スカンディア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5588
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Southern Scandinavia."
msgstr "南部スカンジナビア。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Burning plain;" in Chalcidian Peninsula of Greece
#. where Zeus hurled thunderbolts at Titans to support Hercules.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5590
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Phlegra"
msgstr "プレグラ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5590
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"”Burning plain;” in Chalcidian Peninsula of Greece where Zeus hurled "
"thunderbolts at Titans to support Hercules."
msgstr "「燃える平原」の意味; ギリシャのカルキディアン半島のことで、ゼウスがヘラクレスを支援するためにタイタン族に雷電を投げつけた場所。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); "Lucky journey or lucky return"; i.e., infernal
#. regions beyond Elysium.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5592
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Eunostos"
msgstr "エウノストス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:5592
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"”Lucky journey or lucky return”; i.e., infernal regions beyond Elysium."
msgstr "「幸運な旅か幸運な帰還か」; つまり、エリジウムを超えた地獄の領域です。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mars); Albedo feature name.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:5594
msgctxt "catena"
msgid "Hyblaeus Catena"
msgstr "ヒブラエウス連鎖クレーター"

