msgstr "ヨーア断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8118
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Norwegian; Amundsen's ship through Northwest passage, 1903-06."
msgstr "ノルウェーの船; アムンセンが1903年から1906年に北西航路を通過する時に乗船した。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Dutch; one of Tasman's ships to explore Australia,
#. New Zealand, 1642-43.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8120
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Heemskerck Rupes"
msgstr "ヘームスケルク断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8120 data/nomenclature.fab:8126
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Dutch; one of Tasman's ships to explore Australia, New Zealand, 1642-43."
msgstr "オランダの船; タスマンが1642年から1643年にかけてオーストラリア、ニュージーランドを探検した船団のうちの1隻。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); American; Palmer's ship to explore Antarctic coast,
#. 1820-21.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8122
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Hero Rupes"
msgstr "ヒーロー断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8122
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "American; Palmer's ship to explore Antarctic coast, 1820-21."
msgstr "アメリカの船; パーマーが乗船し1820年から1821年に南極海沿岸を探検した。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Spanish; Columbus' flagship, first voyage to
#. America, 1492.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8124
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Santa María Rupes"
msgstr "サンタ・マリア断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8124
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Spanish; Columbus' flagship, first voyage to America, 1492."
msgstr "スペインの船; コロンブスが1492年にアメリカへの最初の航海を行った艦隊の旗艦。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Dutch; one of Tasman's ships to explore Australia,
#. New Zealand, 1642-43.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8126
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Zeehaen Rupes"
msgstr "ジーハーン断崖"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Russian; Bellingshausen's ship for Antarctic
#. exploration, 1819-21.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8128 data/nomenclature.fab:8190
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Mirni Rupes"
msgstr "ミルニ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8128 data/nomenclature.fab:8150
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8190
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Russian; Bellingshausen's ship for Antarctic exploration, 1819-21."
msgstr "ロシアの船; ベリングスハウゼンが1819年から1821年に南極探検した船。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); French; originally commissioned in 1942 as a
#. minesweeper, Calypso was purchased by Jacques-Yves Cousteau and used for
#. oceanographic studies in 1950-1996.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8130
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Calypso Rupes"
msgstr "カリプソ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8130
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"French; originally commissioned in 1942 as a minesweeper, Calypso was "
"purchased by Jacques-Yves Cousteau and used for oceanographic studies in "
"1950-1996."
msgstr ""
"フランスの船; "
"カリプソ号はもともと掃海艇として1942年に就役したが、ジャック＝イヴ・クストーが購入し、1950年から1996年にかけて海洋調査に使用された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); USSR; Motor-sail schooner to study Earth's magnetic
#. field, 1953.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8132
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Zarya Rupes"
msgstr "ザーリャ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8132
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "USSR; Motor-sail schooner to study Earth's magnetic field, 1953."
msgstr "ソ連邦のスクーナー; 1953年に地磁気観測のために使用した動力付帆船。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); French; Charcot's ship to explore Antarctica,
#. 1908-10.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8134
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Pourquoi-Pas Rupes"
msgstr "ポカ=パ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8134
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "French; Charcot's ship to explore Antarctica, 1908-10."
msgstr "フランスの船; シャルコーが乗り1908年から1910年に南極を探検した。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); English; one of Cook's ships, second expedition to
#. Pacific, 1772-75.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8136
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Resolution Rupes"
msgstr "レゾリューション断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8136
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "English; one of Cook's ships, second expedition to Pacific, 1772-75."
msgstr "イギリスの船; 1772年から1775年のクックの2回目の航海に参加した船のうちの1隻。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Spanish; Magellan's and Del Cano's ship, first
#. voyage around the world.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8138
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Victoria Rupes"
msgstr "ビクトリア断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8138
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Spanish; Magellan's and Del Cano's ship, first voyage around the world."
msgstr "スペインの船; マゼランとデル・カノによって初の世界一周航海をした。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); American; steamship that explored the Mississippi,
#. Amazon, and Madeira Rivers and sailed on a worldwide hydrographic survey
#. 1877 to 1886.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8140
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Enterprise Rupes"
msgstr "エンタープライズ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8140
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"American; steamship that explored the Mississippi, Amazon, and Madeira "
"Rivers and sailed on a worldwide hydrographic survey 1877 to 1886."
msgstr "アメリカの蒸気船。1877年から1886年にかけてミシシッピ川、アマゾン川、マデイラ川を探検し、世界規模の水路測量を行った。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); English; ship of discovery that took part in the
#. Ross Antarctic expedition (1839-1843) and Franklin Arctic expedition
#. (1845).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8142
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Terror Rupes"
msgstr "テラー断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8142
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"English; ship of discovery that took part in the Ross Antarctic expedition "
"(1839-1843) and Franklin Arctic expedition (1845)."
msgstr "イギリスの船; ロスの南極探検 (1839年-1843年) とフランクリンの北極探検 (1845年) に参加した。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); British; naval vessel aboard which Charles Darwin
#. served as a naturalist on a surveying expedition, 1831-1836.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8144
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Beagle Rupes"
msgstr "ビーグル断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8144
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"British; naval vessel aboard which Charles Darwin served as a naturalist on "
"a surveying expedition, 1831-1836."
msgstr "イギリス海軍艦; チャールズ・ダーウィンが博物学者として活躍した1831年から1836年まで測量遠征で使用された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); American; oceanic research and underwater
#. archaeology vessel that performs studies in the Mediterranean and Caribbean
#. since 2009.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8146
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Nautilus Rupes"
msgstr "ノーチラス断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8146
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"American; oceanic research and underwater archaeology vessel that performs "
"studies in the Mediterranean and Caribbean since 2009."
msgstr "アメリカの海洋調査および水中考古学の船; 2009年以来、地中海とカリブ海で研究を行っている。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); American; ice-breaking ship dedicated to scientific
#. research and operated by the National Science Foundation for Antarctic
#. scientific missions since 1992.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8148
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Palmer Rupes"
msgstr "パルマー断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8148
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"American; ice-breaking ship dedicated to scientific research and operated by"
" the National Science Foundation for Antarctic scientific missions since "
"1992."
msgstr "アメリカの砕氷船。科学研究に特化し、1992年から南極科学ミッションのために国立科学財団によって運営されている。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Russian; Bellingshausen's ship for Antarctic
#. exploration, 1819-21.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8150
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Vostok Rupes"
msgstr "ボストーク断崖"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Belgian; ship used for an expedition to determine
#. the position of the South Magnetic Pole in 1898, first ship to winter in
#. Antarctica.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8152
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Belgica Rupes"
msgstr "ベルジカ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8152
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Belgian; ship used for an expedition to determine the position of the South "
"Magnetic Pole in 1898, first ship to winter in Antarctica."
msgstr "ベルギーの船; 1898年に南磁極の位置を決定する遠征に使用され、南極で越冬した最初の船。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); American; U.S.Navy's first deep submergence
#. research vessel commissioned in 1964, designed specifically for
#. oceanographic research.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8154
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Alvin Rupes"
msgstr "アルビン断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8154
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"American; U.S.Navy's first deep submergence research vessel commissioned in "
"1964, designed specifically for oceanographic research."
msgstr "アメリカの潜水艇;  1964 年に就役したアメリカ海軍初の深海調査艇で、海洋調査専用に設計された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); American; oceanographic research vessel with an
#. ice-breaking hull, collected magnetic profiles of the Antarctic sea floor,
#. 1962.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8156
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Eltanin Rupes"
msgstr "エルタニン断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8156
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"American; oceanographic research vessel with an ice-breaking hull, collected"
" magnetic profiles of the Antarctic sea floor, 1962."
msgstr "アメリカの海洋調査船; 砕氷能力を持ち、1962年に南極海海底の磁気プロフィールを収集した。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Dutch; Willem Janszoon's ship credited with the
#. first authenticated European discovery of Australia, 1606.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8158
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Duyfken Rupes"
msgstr "ダイフケン断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8158
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Dutch; Willem Janszoon's ship credited with the first authenticated European"
" discovery of Australia, 1606."
msgstr "オランダの船; 1606年にヨーロッパ人による最初のオーストラリア発見が証明されたウィレム・ヤンスゾーンの船。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); English; research vessel of the Royal Navy used to
#. study magnetism, longitude, and navigation problems, commanded by Edmond
#. Halley from 1698 to 1699.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8160
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Paramour Rupes"
msgstr "パラモア断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8160
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"English; research vessel of the Royal Navy used to study magnetism, "
"longitude, and navigation problems, commanded by Edmond Halley from 1698 to "
"1699."
msgstr "イギリス海軍の調査船; 1698年から1699年までエドモンド・ハレーが指揮し、磁気、経度、航行の問題を研究するために使用された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Japanese; Kainan Maru, ship of Nobu Shirase
#. Antarctic exploration, 1910-1912.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8162
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Kainan Rupēs"
msgstr "カイナン断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8162
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Japanese; Kainan Maru, ship of Nobu Shirase Antarctic exploration, "
"1910-1912."
msgstr "日本の開南丸; 白瀬矗が南極探検 (1910年-1912年) に使用した船。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); German; expedition on Meteor ship explored the
#. South Atlantic Ocean, 1925-1927.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8164
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Meteor Rupēs"
msgstr "メテオール断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8164
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"German; expedition on Meteor ship explored the South Atlantic Ocean, "
"1925-1927."
msgstr "ドイツの船; 探検隊がメテオール号に乗り1925年から1927年にかけて南大西洋を探検した。 "

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Portugese; ship used by D. João de Castro to make a
#. survey of magnetic declination in the Atlantic and Indian Oceans in 1538.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8166
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Grifo Rupes"
msgstr "グリフォ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8166
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Portugese; ship used by D. João de Castro to make a survey of magnetic "
"declination in the Atlantic and Indian Oceans in 1538."
msgstr "ポルトガルの船; 1538年にD・ジョアン・デ・カストロが大西洋とインド洋の磁気偏角の調査に使用した。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Japanese; Japan’s first dedicated Antarctic
#. research vessel (polar voyages in 1956-1962).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8168
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Soya Rupes"
msgstr "ソーヤ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8168
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Japanese; Japan’s first dedicated Antarctic research vessel (polar voyages "
"in 1956-1962)."
msgstr "日本の船; 日本初の南極観測専用船 (1956年から1962年まで南極域へ航海した) 。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); English vessel which took Edmond Halley to Saint
#. Helena in 1676 to conduct a survey of the stars in the southern hemisphere.
#. While there, Halley observed the 1677 transit of Mercury which enabled him
#. to make one of the earliest calculations to estimate t
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8170
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Unity Rupes"
msgstr "ユニティ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8170
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"English vessel which took Edmond Halley to Saint Helena in 1676 to conduct a"
" survey of the stars in the southern hemisphere. While there, Halley "
"observed the 1677 transit of Mercury which enabled him to make one of the "
"earliest calculations to estimate t"
msgstr ""
"イギリスの船; "
"1676年に南半球の恒星の調査を行うためにエドモンド・ハレーをセント・ヘレナ島に連れて行った。そこでハレーは1677年の水星の太陽面通過を観察し、それによってtを推定するための最も初期の計算の1つを行うことができた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); English; Cook's ship on last voyage to Pacific,
#. 1776-80.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8172 data/nomenclature.fab:8184
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Discovery Rupes"
msgstr "ディスカバリー断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8172 data/nomenclature.fab:8184
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "English; Cook's ship on last voyage to Pacific, 1776-80."
msgstr "イギリスの船; クックが1776年から1780年に太平洋で最後に航海した時の船。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Chilean; a steam-powered cutter that rescued the
#. crew of the Endurance in the Antarctic in 1916.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8174
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Yelcho Rupes"
msgstr "イェルチョ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8174
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Chilean; a steam-powered cutter that rescued the crew of the Endurance in "
"the Antarctic in 1916."
msgstr "チリの蒸気カッター; 1916年に南極でエンデュランス号の乗組員を救出した。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Australian; research vessel used since 2014 for
#. atmospheric, oceanographic, biological and geoscience research from the
#. tropical north to the Antarctic ice-edge mainly in the Indian and Pacific
#. Oceans.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8176
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Investigator Rupes"
msgstr "インベスティゲーター断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8176
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Australian; research vessel used since 2014 for atmospheric, oceanographic, "
"biological and geoscience research from the tropical north to the Antarctic "
"ice-edge mainly in the Indian and Pacific Oceans."
msgstr ""
"オーストラリアの調査船; 2014年から主にインド洋と太平洋の熱帯北部から南極の氷縁までの大気、海洋、生物学、地球科学の研究に使用されている。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Japanese; a scientific drilling ship built for the
#. Integrated Ocean Drilling Program to conduct deep-sea geological research.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8178
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Chikyu Rupes"
msgstr "チキュウ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8178
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Japanese; a scientific drilling ship built for the Integrated Ocean Drilling"
" Program to conduct deep-sea geological research."
msgstr "日本の科学掘削船「ちきゅう」; 深海の地質調査を行うための統合海洋掘削プログラムのために建造された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); English; ship used for an expedition to discover
#. the Northwest Passage, 1825-1827.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8180
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Blossom Rupes"
msgstr "ブロッサム断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8180
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"English; ship used for an expedition to discover the Northwest Passage, "
"1825-1827."
msgstr "イギリスの船; 1825年から1827年の北西航路啓開のための遠征隊で使用された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Brazilian; an oceanographic research vessel
#. investigating the role of the South Atlantic in global climate change, as
#. well as studying marine biodiversity.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8182
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Alpha Crucis Rupēs"
msgstr "アルファ・クルシス断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8182
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Brazilian; an oceanographic research vessel investigating the role of the "
"South Atlantic in global climate change, as well as studying marine "
"biodiversity."
msgstr "ブラジルの海洋調査研究船; 地球規模の気候変動における南大西洋の役割を調査し、海洋生物多様性を研究する。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Mexican; oceanographic vessel used for academic and
#. federal research in the Pacific (2000s).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8186
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Altair Rupes"
msgstr "アルタイル断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8186
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Mexican; oceanographic vessel used for academic and federal research in the "
"Pacific (2000s)."
msgstr "メキシコの海洋調査船; 太平洋における学術研究と連邦研究 (2000年代) に使用された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); French; royal ship used for a voyage in search of
#. the eastern coast of Asia, determined that North America was not an
#. extension of Asia, 1524.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8188
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "La Dauphine Rupes"
msgstr "ラ・ドフィーヌ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8188
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"French; royal ship used for a voyage in search of the eastern coast of Asia,"
" determined that North America was not an extension of Asia, 1524."
msgstr "フランス王室の船; 1524年北米はアジアの延長ではないと判断し、アジアの東海岸を探す航海に使用された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); British; survey ship used to undertake the first
#. global marine research expedition, the Challenger Expedition (1872-1876),
#. which laid the foundation for the science of oceanography.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8192
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Challenger Rupes"
msgstr "チャレンジャー断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8192
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"British; survey ship used to undertake the first global marine research "
"expedition, the Challenger Expedition (1872-1876), which laid the foundation"
" for the science of oceanography."
msgstr "イギリスの調査船; 海洋学の基礎を築いた、最初の世界的な海洋調査遠征であるチャレンジャー遠征 (1872年-1876年) で使用された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Chinese; a polar research vessel used for Arctic
#. and Antarctic expeditions in the 2010s.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8194
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Xuelong Rupes"
msgstr "シュエロン断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8194
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Chinese; a polar research vessel used for Arctic and Antarctic expeditions "
"in the 2010s."
msgstr "中国の極地調査船「雪龍」; 2010年代の北極と南極の調査に使用された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Canadian; hydrographic survey and oceanographic
#. research vessel (1913- 1969), used to chart the coastline of Eastern
#. Canada, performed tidal and depth charting.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8196
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Acadia Rupes"
msgstr "アカディア断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8196
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Canadian; hydrographic survey and oceanographic research vessel (1913- "
"1969), used to chart the coastline of Eastern Canada, performed tidal and "
"depth charting."
msgstr ""
"カナダの船; 水路測量および海洋調査船 (1913年-1969年) 。カナダ東部の海岸線の図を作成するために使用され、潮汐図および深度図が作成された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); New Zealand; a research vessel and icebreaker that
#. performs marine environmental monitoring, ocean science studies and
#. exploration and engineering activities (2000s).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8198
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Tangaroa Rupes"
msgstr "タンガロア断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8198
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"New Zealand; a research vessel and icebreaker that performs marine "
"environmental monitoring, ocean science studies and exploration and "
"engineering activities (2000s)."
msgstr "ニュージーランドの調査船および砕氷船; 海洋環境モニタリング、海洋科学研究、探査および工学活動を行う (2000年代) 。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); South African; research vessel that performed
#. hydrographic surveys (1922-1933).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8200
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Protea Rupes"
msgstr "プロテア断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8200
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"South African; research vessel that performed hydrographic surveys "
"(1922-1933)."
msgstr "南アフリカの調査船; 水路測量 (1922年-1933年) を行った。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Argentinian; ship involved in oceanographic surveys
#. in Southwestern Atlantic; performed 10 oceanographic cruises (1962-1976).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8202
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Zapiola Rupes"
msgstr "ザピオラ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8202
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Argentinian; ship involved in oceanographic surveys in Southwestern "
"Atlantic; performed 10 oceanographic cruises (1962-1976)."
msgstr "アルゼンチンの船; 南西大西洋の海洋調査に携わり、10回の海洋調査航海 (1962年-1976年) を行った。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Greek; research vessel that performs geophysical,
#. geological, and hydrographic surveys in the Mediterranean Sea since 1985.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8204
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Aegaeo Rupes"
msgstr "アエガエオ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8204
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Greek; research vessel that performs geophysical, geological, and "
"hydrographic surveys in the Mediterranean Sea since 1985."
msgstr "ギリシャの観測船; 1985年以来、地中海で地球物理学、地質学、水路測量を行っている。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Bulgarian; a research vessel for geological,
#. biological, chemical, physical, and ecological investigations in the Black
#. Sea since 1979.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8206
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Akademik Rupes"
msgstr "アカデミク断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8206
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Bulgarian; a research vessel for geological, biological, chemical, physical,"
" and ecological investigations in the Black Sea since 1979."
msgstr "ブルガリアの調査船; 1979年以来黒海の地質学的、生物学的、化学的、物理的、生態学的な調査を行う。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Origin: Portuguese; a coastal research vessel which
#. has been used in research programs in the Northeast Atlantic (Azores,
#. Madeira) up to 30°N (2010s).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8208
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Arquipelago Rupēs"
msgstr "アーキペラゴウ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8208
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Origin: Portuguese; a coastal research vessel which has been used in "
"research programs in the Northeast Atlantic (Azores, Madeira) up to 30°N "
"(2010s)."
msgstr ""
"元はポルトガルの沿岸調査船; 北東大西洋 (アゾレス諸島、マデイラ島) から北緯30度までの調査プログラム (2010年代) に使用されてきた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Peruvian; a multidisciplinary oceanographic
#. research vessel operated by the Peruvian Navy.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8210
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Carrasco Rupēs"
msgstr "カラスコ断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8210
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Peruvian; a multidisciplinary oceanographic research vessel operated by the "
"Peruvian Navy."
msgstr "ペルーの学際的な海洋調査船; ペルー海軍が運用する。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Mexican; an oceanographic research vessel for
#. hydrography, meteorology, and oceanography studies (since 1968).
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8212
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Antares Rupes"
msgstr "アンタレス断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8212
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Mexican; an oceanographic research vessel for hydrography, meteorology, and "
"oceanography studies (since 1968)."
msgstr "メキシコの海洋調査船; (1968年以降) 水路学、気象学、海洋学の研究のための船 。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Italian; multi-purpose research vessel used in
#. particular for investigations in fisheries, aquaculture, oceanography
#. within the Mediterranean Sea since 2003.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8214
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Astrea Rupes"
msgstr "アストレア断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8214
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Italian; multi-purpose research vessel used in particular for investigations"
" in fisheries, aquaculture, oceanography within the Mediterranean Sea since "
"2003."
msgstr "イタリアの多目的調査船; 2003年以来、特に地中海の漁業、養殖、海洋学の調査に使用されている。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Taiwanese; a research vessel used since 2018 for
#. oceanographic observations, seafloor topographic mapping, seismic survey
#. and sediment coring in the Pacific Ocean area adjacent to East Asia.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8216
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Legend Rupes"
msgstr "レジェンド断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8216
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Taiwanese; a research vessel used since 2018 for oceanographic observations,"
" seafloor topographic mapping, seismic survey and sediment coring in the "
"Pacific Ocean area adjacent to East Asia."
msgstr "台湾の調査船; 2018年から東アジアに隣接する太平洋地域の海洋観測、海底地形図作成、地震調査、堆積物のコア調査に使用されている。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Turkish; research vessel used mainly in Sea of
#. Marmara since 2010 for high resolution geophysical exploration in shallow
#. waters.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8218
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Selen Rupēs"
msgstr "セイエン断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8218
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Turkish; research vessel used mainly in Sea of Marmara since 2010 for high "
"resolution geophysical exploration in shallow waters."
msgstr "トルコの調査船; 2010年以来主にマルマラ海で浅海での高解像度地球物理探査で使用されている。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Indian; a hydrographic survey vessel that carries
#. out hydrographic, geophysical, and oceanographic surveys in the Indian
#. Ocean since 2001; has been used to investigate historically significant
#. shipwrecks and the submerged remains of the lost city of Poom
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8220
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Darshak Rupēs"
msgstr "ダルシャク断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8220
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Indian; a hydrographic survey vessel that carries out hydrographic, "
"geophysical, and oceanographic surveys in the Indian Ocean since 2001; has "
"been used to investigate historically significant shipwrecks and the "
"submerged remains of the lost city of Poom"
msgstr ""
"インドの水路測量船; "
"2001年以来インド洋での水路、地球物理学、海洋調査を実施している。歴史的に重要な難破船や失われた都市プームの水没遺跡を調査するために使用されてきた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Colombian; a research vessel used for biological,
#. meteorological, chemistry, physics, geology, and oceanographic studies in
#. the Caribbean Sea and Pacific Ocean since 1981.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8222
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Providencia Rupes"
msgstr "プロビデンシア断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8222
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Colombian; a research vessel used for biological, meteorological, chemistry,"
" physics, geology, and oceanographic studies in the Caribbean Sea and "
"Pacific Ocean since 1981."
msgstr "コロンビアの調査船; 1981年以来、カリブ海と太平洋の生物学、気象学、化学、物理学、地質学、海洋学の研究に使用されている。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Spanish; a global research vessel, used since 1991
#. for studies of geology, geophysics, hydrography, physical and chemical
#. oceanography, marine biology as well as for logistical support to the
#. Spanish Antarctic bases.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8224
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Hesperides Rupes"
msgstr "ヘスペリデス断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8224
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Spanish; a global research vessel, used since 1991 for studies of geology, "
"geophysics, hydrography, physical and chemical oceanography, marine biology "
"as well as for logistical support to the Spanish Antarctic bases."
msgstr ""
"スペインの総合調査船; "
"1991年以来、地質学、地球物理学、水路学、物理化学海洋学、海洋生物学の研究のほか、スペインの南極基地への後方支援にも使用されている。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Dutch; a research and survey vessel that has
#. performed hydrographic and oceanographic surveys and sediment sampling
#. since 1990 in the Atlantic (North Sea, Caribbean Sea), Indian, and Pacific
#. Oceans.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8226
msgctxt "rupes"
msgid "Pelagia Rupes"
msgstr "ペラギア断崖"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8226
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Dutch; a research and survey vessel that has performed hydrographic and "
"oceanographic surveys and sediment sampling since 1990 in the Atlantic "
"(North Sea, Caribbean Sea), Indian, and Pacific Oceans."
msgstr "オランダの調査測量船; 1990年以来大西洋 (北海、カリブ海) 、インド洋、太平洋で水路海洋調査と堆積物サンプリングを行っている。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Ancient city in Algeria.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8228
msgctxt "vallis"
msgid "Timgad Vallis"
msgstr "ティムガッド峡谷"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8228
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Ancient city in Algeria."
msgstr "アルジェリアの古代都市。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Ancient city in the Supe Valley, Peru.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8230
msgctxt "vallis"
msgid "Caral Vallis"
msgstr "カラル峡谷"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8230
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Ancient city in the Supe Valley, Peru."
msgstr "ペルー、スーペ峡谷にあった古代都市。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Ancient city in Cambodia.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8232
msgctxt "vallis"
msgid "Angkor Vallis"
msgstr "アンコール峡谷"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8232
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Ancient city in Cambodia."
msgstr "カンボジアの古代都市。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Cahokia Mounds, ancient city in southern Illinois,
#. USA.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8234
msgctxt "vallis"
msgid "Cahokia Vallis"
msgstr "カホキア峡谷"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8234
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Cahokia Mounds, ancient city in southern Illinois, USA."
msgstr "カホキア土塁、米国イリノイ州南部の古代都市。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mercury); Ancient city in the Campania region of Italy.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8236
msgctxt "vallis"
msgid "Paestum Vallis"
msgstr "パエストゥム峡谷"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8236
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Ancient city in the Campania region of Italy."
msgstr "イタリア、カンパニア地方の古代都市。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Arthurian knight.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8238
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Bedivere"
msgstr "ベディヴィア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8238
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Arthurian knight."
msgstr "アーサー王の騎士。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Eldest son of King Lot; Arthur's favorite cousin.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8240
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Gawain"
msgstr "ガウェイン"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8240
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Eldest son of King Lot; Arthur's favorite cousin."
msgstr "ロト王の長男; アーサーのお気に入りのいとこ。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Companion of Arthur's; he was tricked into jousting
#. with Arthur.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8242
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Accolon"
msgstr "アコロン"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8242
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Companion of Arthur's; he was tricked into jousting with Arthur."
msgstr "アーサーの仲間; だまされてアーサーと馬上槍試合をさせられた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); King of the Round Table Assemblage.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8244
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Arthur"
msgstr "アーサー"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8244
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "King of the Round Table Assemblage."
msgstr "円卓会議の王。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Knight of "matchless courage and virtue."
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8246
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Balin"
msgstr "ベイリン"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8246
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Knight of “matchless courage and virtue.”"
msgstr "「比類のない勇気と美徳」の騎士。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); King of Benwick; father of Sir Launcelot, ally of
#. Arthur in the battle of Bedgrayne.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8248
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Ban"
msgstr "バン"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8248
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"King of Benwick; father of Sir Launcelot, ally of Arthur in the battle of "
"Bedgrayne."
msgstr "ベンウィック王; ベドグレインの戦いでアーサーの同盟者であるランスロット卿の父親。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Very pure knight; accomplished quest of Holy Grail.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8250
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Percivale"
msgstr "パーシヴァル"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8250
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Very pure knight; accomplished quest of Holy Grail."
msgstr "とても純粋な騎士。聖杯の探求を成し遂げた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); King of Gaul; father of Sir Ector de Marys, Sir Bors,
#. Sir Lyonel.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8252
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Bors"
msgstr "ボールス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8252
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "King of Gaul; father of Sir Ector de Marys, Sir Bors, Sir Lyonel."
msgstr "ガリアの王; エクター・デ・メアリーズ卿、ボールス卿、ライオネル卿の父親。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Bastard son of Launcelot and Elaine. He went on the
#. quest to find the Holy Grail.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8254
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Galahad"
msgstr "ガラハッド"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8254
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Bastard son of Launcelot and Elaine. He went on the quest to find the Holy "
"Grail."
msgstr "ランスロットとエレインの私生児。聖杯を探す旅を続けた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Fool at King Arthur's court.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8256
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Dagonet"
msgstr "ダゴネット"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8256
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Fool at King Arthur's court."
msgstr "アーサー王の宮廷にいる愚か者。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Butler at King Arthur's court.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8258
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Lucas"
msgstr "ルーカス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8258
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Butler at King Arthur's court."
msgstr "アーサー王の宮廷執事。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Delivers poison wound to Tristram before being
#. mortally wounded by him.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8260
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Marhaus"
msgstr "マーハウス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8260
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Delivers poison wound to Tristram before being mortally wounded by him."
msgstr "トリストラムに致命傷を負わせる前に毒傷を負わせる。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); King of Lyoness; marries King Mark's sister, who dies
#. bearing their son, Sir Tristram.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8262
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Melyodas"
msgstr "メリオダス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8262
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"King of Lyoness; marries King Mark's sister, who dies bearing their son, Sir"
" Tristram."
msgstr "ライオネスの王; マーク王の妹と結婚するが、その人は息子トリストラム卿を産んで亡くなる。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); King of the West, principal enemy of Arthur.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8264
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Nero"
msgstr "ネロ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8264 data/nomenclature.fab:8266
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "King of the West, principal enemy of Arthur."
msgstr "西国の王、アーサー王の主な敵。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); King of the West, principal enemy of Arthur.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8266
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Royns"
msgstr "ロインス"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Daughter of King Pelles, lover of Sir Launcelot and
#. mother, by him, of Sir Galahad.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8268
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Elaine"
msgstr "エレイン"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8268
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Daughter of King Pelles, lover of Sir Launcelot and mother, by him, of Sir "
"Galahad."
msgstr "ペレス王の娘、ランスロット卿の恋人で、ランスロット卿の側にいるガラハッド卿の母。"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8270
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"William; German-British astronomer; discovered Mimas and Enceladus "
"(1738-1822)."
msgstr "ウィリアム; ドイツ系イギリス人の天文学者 (1738-1822) 。ミマスとエンケラドゥスを発見した。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); A knight of the Round Table.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8272
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Dynas"
msgstr "ディナス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8272
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "A knight of the Round Table."
msgstr "円卓の騎士。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Older son of King Lot; killed by Sir Launcelot in his
#. rescue of Gwynevere from burning.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8274
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Gaheris"
msgstr "ガヘリス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8274
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Older son of King Lot; killed by Sir Launcelot in his rescue of Gwynevere "
"from burning."
msgstr "ロト王の長男; 火災からグウィネヴィアを救出したランスロット卿によって殺害された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Youngest son of King Lot; killed by Sir Launcelot in
#. his rescue of Gwynevere from burning.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8276
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Gareth"
msgstr "ガレス"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8276
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Youngest son of King Lot; killed by Sir Launcelot in his rescue of Gwynevere"
" from burning."
msgstr "ロト王の末息子; 火災からグウィネヴィアを救出したランスロット卿によって殺害された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Wife of Uther; mother of Arthur.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8278
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Igraine"
msgstr "イグレイン"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8278
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Wife of Uther; mother of Arthur."
msgstr "ウーサーの妻; アーサーの母親。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); King Arthur's favorite; champion and lover of Queen
#. Gwynevere.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8280
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Launcelot"
msgstr "ローンスロット"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8280
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "King Arthur's favorite; champion and lover of Queen Gwynevere."
msgstr "アーサー王のお気に入り; チャンピオンであり、グウィネヴィア女王の恋人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Queen; wife of Arthur; lover of Launcelot.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8282
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Gwynevere"
msgstr "グインネヴィア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8282
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Queen; wife of Arthur; lover of Launcelot."
msgstr "女王;アーサーの妻。ランスロットの恋人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Royal seneschal at Arthur's court.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8284
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Kay"
msgstr "ケイ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8284
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Royal seneschal at Arthur's court."
msgstr "アーサー王の宮廷の王室長。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Loved by Tristram.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8286
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Iseult"
msgstr "イズールト"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8286
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Loved by Tristram."
msgstr "トリストラムに愛された人。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Pellinore's son; sent testing horn to King Mark to
#. expose adultery of Sir Tristram.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8288
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Lamerok"
msgstr "ラモラック"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8288
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Pellinore's son; sent testing horn to King Mark to expose adultery of Sir "
"Tristram."
msgstr "ペリノアの息子; トリストラム卿の姦淫を暴露するためにマーク王に実験用の角笛を送った。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Leader of the rebel kings of the north and west.
#. Married Margawse and begat Sir Gawain, Sir Aggravayne, Sir Gaheris.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8290
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Lot"
msgstr "ロット"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8290
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Leader of the rebel kings of the north and west. Married Margawse and begat "
"Sir Gawain, Sir Aggravayne, Sir Gaheris."
msgstr "北と西の反乱軍の王の指導者。マーゴースと結婚し、ガウェイン卿、アグラヴェイン卿、ガヘリス卿をもうけた。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); King of Cornwall.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8292
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Mark"
msgstr "マーク"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8292
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "King of Cornwall."
msgstr "コーンウォールの王。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Magician and prophet; son of the devil; Arthur's
#. mentor.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8294
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Merlin"
msgstr "マーリン"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8294
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Magician and prophet; son of the devil; Arthur's mentor."
msgstr "魔術師であり預言者。悪魔の息子。アーサーの指導者。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Arthur's bastard son and mortal enemy; delivered
#. fatal wound to Arthur but was killed by him.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8296
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Modred"
msgstr "モウドリッド"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8296
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Arthur's bastard son and mortal enemy; delivered fatal wound to Arthur but "
"was killed by him."
msgstr "アーサーの私生児であり不倶戴天の敵。アーサーに致命傷を与えたが、彼によって殺された。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Arthur's half sister; enchantress; plotted to destroy
#. Arthur but failed.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8298
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Morgan"
msgstr "モーガン"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8298
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Arthur's half sister; enchantress; plotted to destroy Arthur but failed."
msgstr "アーサーの異母妹、魔法使い、アーサーを滅ぼそうと画策するが失敗した。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); King whose duty was to pursue the questing beast and
#. either run it to earth or lose his strength.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8300
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Pellinore"
msgstr "ペリノア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:8300
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"King whose duty was to pursue the questing beast and either run it to earth "
"or lose his strength."
msgstr "探索する獣を追跡し、地上に追い出すか、力を失うかのどちらかを任務とする王。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Mimas); Saracen enemy of Tristam.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:8302
