msgstr "人々に正しい生き方を教えるニューギニアの創造と知識の女神。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Titan); Egyptian goddess of knowledge, writing, education,
#. and reptiles.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:27306
msgctxt "crater"
msgid "Selk"
msgstr "セルク"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:27306
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Egyptian goddess of knowledge, writing, education, and reptiles."
msgstr "エジプトの知識、書記、教育、爬虫類の女神。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Titan); Lakota and Oglala (South Dakota, USA) god of wisdom.
