msgstr "クサ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:27308
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Lakota and Oglala (South Dakota, USA) god of wisdom."
msgstr "ラコタ族とオグララ族 (米国サウスダコタ州) の知恵の神。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Titan); Etruscan goddess of wisdom.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:27310
