msgstr "シンラプ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:27312
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Kachin (N. Burma) wise spirit who dwells in the sky and gives wisdom to his "
"worshippers."
msgstr "カチン族 (ビルマ北部) の賢明な精霊。天に住み、崇拝者に知恵を与える。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Titan); Chumash (California, USA) ancestor shaman and goddess
