"unalloyed happiness."
msgstr "中国仏教の楽園。救いを達成した人々が純粋な幸福の中で暮らすことができる場所。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Titan); Sumerian garden of paradise, primeval land of bliss.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:27342
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Dilmun"
msgstr "ディルムン"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:27342
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Sumerian garden of paradise, primeval land of bliss."
msgstr "シュメールの楽園、原始の至福の地。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Titan); Oasis of happiness in the African desert, from an
#. Italian legend.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:27344
msgctxt "albedo feature"
