msgstr "メッゾラミア"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:27344
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Oasis of happiness in the African desert, from an Italian legend."
msgstr "イタリアの伝説に伝わる、アフリカの砂漠にある幸福のオアシス。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Titan); Legendary city in the American Southwest; site of a
#. fabulous treasure sought by Coronado and other explorers.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:27346
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Quivira"
msgstr "キビラ"

