" by Coronado and other explorers."
msgstr "アメリカ南西部の伝説的な都市; コロナドや他の探検家が探し求めた素晴らしい宝のある場所。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Titan); Japanese ideal realm of aloofness and serenity,
#. freedom from wordly cares and death.
