msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Senkyo"
msgstr "センキョー"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:27348
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Japanese ideal realm of aloofness and serenity, freedom from wordly cares "
"and death."
msgstr "日本の考えで、飄々とした静謐な理想の境地、言葉の心配や死からの自由。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Titan); Tibetan mythical land of eternal youth.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:27350
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Shangri-La"
msgstr "シャングリ=ラ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:27350
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Tibetan mythical land of eternal youth."
msgstr "チベット神話にある永遠の若さの国。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Titan); Navajo sacred place.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:27352
msgctxt "albedo feature"
msgid "Tsegihi"
msgstr "ツェギヒ"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:27352
msgctxt "origin"
msgid "Navajo sacred place."
msgstr "ナバホ族の聖地。"

#. TRANSLATORS: (Titan); One of the seven gods of happiness in Japanese
#. Buddhism. He is the god of contentment, good fortune, cheerfulness, and he
#. is always smiling.
