#. group of fictional people whose culture revolves around preservation and
#. conservation of water, which is a rare commodity on the planet.
#: data/nomenclature.fab:27788
msgctxt "planitia"
msgid "Arrakis Planitia"
msgstr "アラキス平原"

#: data/nomenclature.fab:27788
msgctxt "origin"
msgid ""
"Planet from the Dune series; home of the Fremen, a group of fictional people"
" whose culture revolves around preservation and conservation of water, which"
" is a rare commodity on the planet."
msgstr ""
